45
00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:05.970
And then a couple of years ago, Earwolf and its partner Stitcher got bought by SiriusXM.

46
00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:14.910
So now it's kind of all under SiriusXM, and they started implementing some changes, like how they closed down the Earwolf recording studio.

47
00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:19.790
And then they did layoffs, and then the layoffs included you, Sam.

48
00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:23.610
And it all took us completely by surprise.

49
00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:26.010
I mean, we learned about it when you texted us.

50
00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:27.750
Yeah, I learned about it by surprise, too.

51
00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:28.850
Yeah, you did.

52
00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:31.770
