62
00:02:57.850 --> 00:02:57.930
Oh, my gosh.

63
00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:58.610
Yeah.

64
00:02:58.830 --> 00:02:59.030
Ready?

65
00:02:59.310 --> 00:02:59.490
Yeah.

