2198
01:33:22.730 --> 01:33:23.550
Like, who?

2199
01:33:23.750 --> 01:33:24.330
Who knew?

2200
01:33:24.890 --> 01:33:25.830
Oh, wow.

2201
01:33:26.110 --> 01:33:26.430
Uh-huh.

